(TCPC positive-B C45 sphere baseline - T3 Attempt 7 resume segment 2.)
(Continues the same logical attempt from canonical seq30 after a no-touch.)
(No WCS changes. No G43/G49 changes. TCPC must already be ON.)

(Operator setup:)
(1. Use only with the frozen Attempt 7 prefix ending at accepted seq29.)
(2. Start at B30 C90 at the exact top-touch no-contact return position.)
(3. T3/H3 and the probe installation must be unchanged from seq1-29.)
(4. The failed execution logged no seq30 row and made no accepted contact.)
(5. Keep hand on feed hold/stop for the continuation.)
(6. C135/C315 remain collision omissions; C225 retains both holds.)
(7. This runner installs frozen T3 #3032 before probing.)
(8. Outside-G38 probe repeats reset the clear timer without pausing.)
(9. Required pre-run CSV SHA256 is 3ab368e1770ae561e4832771430312de3)
(   fccb797dafc0ac5c087dddc9d7df45b.)
(10. One-shot: do not rerun after this segment appends any accepted row.)

